{"id":"000VFP","title":"Zero Sum Game","author":"unordered_mat","solvedCount":14,"difficulty":4,"rating":"84 %","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"am 10. Oktober 2026, 19:14 Uhr","rules":"Rules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply.\n\nNEGATOR CELLS:\nEach row, column and 3x3 box contains exactly one Negator cell. Each Negator cell contains a different digit.\nThe value of a Negator cell is equal to the negative of its digit, e.g. a 3 in a Negator cell has a value of -3.\n\nKILLER CAGES:\nThe values of cells in a cage sum to the number in the top left corner of the cage. Digits don't repeat in a cage.\n\nSANDWICH CLUES:\nNumbers outside the grid give the sum of the values sandwiched between the digits 1 and 9 in that row/column.\n\nREGION SUM LINES:\nThe 3x3 box borders divide the blue lines into segments.\nThe values on each segment of an individual line sum to the same total. This total may be different for different lines.\n\nZERO SUMS:\nValues that are on the same grey shape sum to zero.\n\nSolve on SudokuPad","solutionCode":"Digits in row 2 from left to right.","tags":["Sudoku","Killer (Variante)","Region Sum Lines (Variante)","Sandwich (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/aj257hnjoy","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/aj257hnjoy","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":7,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","underlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00"}